@startuml
title Activity - UC-12 Báo cáo & Thống kê (Pipeline)
start
:Define report request (type, time range);
:Check cache for precomputed dataset;
if (Cache hit?) then (yes)
  :Load dataset;
  :Render charts/tables;
  stop
else (no)
  :Trigger/Use latest aggregates;
endif

fork
  :Ingest events (gps, checkin, trips) from Kafka;
  :ETL in Spark: cleanse, join, aggregate by date/route/trip;
  :Persist aggregates to DB/S3 (fact tables);
fork again
  :Schedule batch recomputation daily;
  :Backfill missing partitions if needed;
end fork

:Query aggregates for the request;
:Compute KPIs (on-time %, utilization, check-in ratio);
:Format result dataset;
:Cache result for TTL;
:Render charts/tables;
stop
@enduml